{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/625","id":5054729232,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU-xXos8AAAABLUkMEA","html_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/625","diff_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/625.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/625.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/625","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/625/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/625/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/issues/625/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mw00/project-maya/statuses/9fc017b17c9c17ceb3527347ff12dcb5ced85c1c","number":625,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"serve: stable tool order on the DeepSeek paths too (a reordered tool list re-rendered the prompt head, so the engine re-read the conversation)","user":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Problem.** On the DeepSeek paths a request whose `tools` list arrives in a different order renders the tool block, at the prompt's head, in that new order. The engine's prefix match then breaks at the system prompt and it re-reads the whole conversation. Agent clients do reorder tools (an MCP hub's server order, plugin tools registered late). On 2x CMP 170HX that is ~33-38 s for a 60K-token conversation (an estimate: 60K tokens at the 1700-1850 tok/s we measured for 16K-32K fresh prompts; platform-specific).\n\n**Cause** (v1.1.35):\n\n- `serve/frontend.py:491` (`openai_to_messages`, DeepSeek branch): `tools = tools_from_openai_format(declared) if declared else None`, with no `stable_tool_order`, unlike the legacy path at `:534`.\n- `serve/frontend.py:601-602` (`anthropic_to_messages`): `if not deepseek: tools = stable_tool_order(tools)`, so DeepSeek is excluded explicitly.\n\n**Fix.**\n\n- `stable_tool_order` on the DeepSeek OpenAI and Anthropic paths too. `tools_from_openai_format` returns flat dicts keyed by the namespace-qualified encoding name (`ns::name`), so namespaced tools with equal names stay distinct. It is the trade the legacy path already makes: a reordered turn renders bit-identical to the first-seen order, schemas untouched.\n- Test isolation: `stable_tool_order`'s memory (`_TOOL_ORDERS`) is process-global and the DeepSeek converters use it now, so the DeepSeek conformance goldens (`serve/test_ds41_conformance.py`) clear it in `setUp` and no longer depend on test order.\n\n**Output:** a DeepSeek prompt whose tools arrive in a new order now renders them in the first-seen order (the same set, the same schemas). Unchanged for a request whose order does not change, and for the legacy path.\n\n**Tests.** `serve/test_server.py` `StableToolOrder` gains `test_deepseek_paths_are_stabilized_too` (OpenAI and Anthropic DeepSeek converters, the same set in three orders) and `test_deepseek_namespaced_tools_key_on_the_encoding_name`; both fail on v1.1.35's `frontend.py` and pass with the fix. Not measured end to end: we did not replay a rotated-tool session through the server. This is a prefix-reuse fix, not a speed claim.\n\n**Checks** (as `.github/workflows/tests.yml`): `tools/check_hip_compat.py` OK; server tests 465 OK (12 skipped; v1.1.35 runs 463 - the two new DeepSeek tool-order tests); installer and tools tests 584 OK (31 skipped).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T17:21:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:50:13Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T07:50:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"409ee2d1b2e1373996bf3fae99763f8943042b08","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SeriousRising:serve-ds4-tool-order","ref":"serve-ds4-tool-order","repo":{"id":1437354424,"node_id":"R_kgDOVaxJuA","name":"project-maya","full_name":"SeriousRising/project-maya","owner":{"login":"SeriousRising","id":69419008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDE5MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69419008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising","html_url":"https://github.com/SeriousRising","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeriousRising/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","s